<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>聊天关系分析报告</title>
<style>
:root{--self:#2b6cb0;--partner:#c53030;--ink:#1a202c;--muted:#64748b;--line:#e2e8f0;--bg:#f7fafc}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.65 -apple-system,"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 64px}
h1{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 6px}
.meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.8}
.tag{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:1px 8px;margin-right:6px;background:#fff}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(148px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:16px 0}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px}
.card .k{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.card .v{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;word-break:break-all}
.card .s{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-top:2px}
section{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:14px 0}
section h2{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 4px}
.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin:8px 0 0}
.narrative{margin:6px 0 0;line-height:1.9;white-space:pre-wrap}
.chart{width:100%;height:320px}
.chart.tall{height:400px}
.duo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
@media(max-width:760px){.duo{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.warn{background:#fffaf0;border:1px solid #e6c34a;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0}
.warn h2{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px;color:#8a6116}
.warn p{margin:0;font-size:13px}
.bar{display:flex;height:10px;border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;background:#edf2f7;margin:10px 0 6px}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%}
.legend{display:flex;gap:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);flex-wrap:wrap}
.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
td.n,th.n{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.milestones-timeline{margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.milestone-item{border-left:3px solid var(--self);padding-left:12px;margin-left:4px}
.m-date{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.m-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:2px 0}
.m-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <h1>聊天关系分析报告</h1>
  <div class="meta">
    <span class="tag">会话指纹 {{.View.Meta.TalkerHash}}</span>
    <span class="tag">{{date .View.Meta.RangeStartMs}} — {{date .View.Meta.RangeEndMs}}</span>
    <span class="tag">行为模型 {{.View.Meta.BehaviorModelVersion}}</span>
    <span class="tag">情感模型 {{.View.Meta.SentimentModelVersion}}</span>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="warn">
  <h2>先读这里</h2>
  <p>{{.View.Disclaimer}}</p>
</div>

<section>
  <h2>这段时间</h2>
  {{if .View.Narrative}}
  <p class="narrative">{{.View.Narrative}}</p>
  {{else}}
  <p class="note">{{.View.NarrativeNote}}</p>
  {{end}}
  <p class="note">这一段由本机模型仅依据上面的聚合统计写成，它读不到任何一条消息原文，也可能把数字说得比它们实际能支撑的更顺；请把它当一段概括，而不是结论。</p>
</section>

{{if .View.Highlights.Present}}
<section>
  <h2>关系高光与里程碑</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card"><div class="k">启程之日</div><div class="v">{{.View.Highlights.StartDate}}</div><div class="s">已走过 {{.View.Highlights.JourneyDays}} 天</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="k">最长连续聊天</div><div class="v">{{.View.Highlights.MaxStreakDays}} 天</div><div class="s">{{.View.Highlights.StreakPeriod}}</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="milestones-timeline">
    {{range .View.Highlights.Events}}
    <div class="milestone-item">
      <div class="m-date">{{.Date}}</div>
      <div class="m-title">{{.Title}}</div>
      <div class="m-desc">{{.Description}}</div>
    </div>
    {{end}}
  </div>
</section>
{{end}}

<div class="cards">
  <div class="card"><div class="k">总消息</div><div class="v">{{.View.Summary.SelfMsgs | add .View.Summary.PartnerMsgs}}</div><div class="s">我 {{.View.Summary.SelfMsgs}} · 对方 {{.View.Summary.PartnerMsgs}}</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">有聊天记录的天数</div><div class="v">{{.View.Summary.DayCount}}</div><div class="s">共 {{.View.Summary.ConversationCount}} 段对话</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">平均每条字数</div><div class="v">{{num1 .View.Summary.AvgPartnerLen}}</div><div class="s">我 {{num1 .View.Summary.AvgSelfLen}}</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">深夜消息占比</div><div class="v">{{pct .View.Summary.LateNightRatio}}</div><div class="s">23:00 之后发出</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">我发起对话的比例</div><div class="v">{{pct .View.Summary.InitiatorRatio}}</div><div class="s">按每段对话首条计</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">我当天开场 / 收尾</div><div class="v">{{.View.Summary.DailyFirstIsSelfCount}} / {{.View.Summary.DailyLastIsSelfCount}}</div><div class="s">天数为单位</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">回复中位数</div><div class="v">{{span .View.Summary.Reply.MedianMs}}</div><div class="s">P90 {{span .View.Summary.Reply.P90Ms}}</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">一分钟内回复</div><div class="v">{{pct .View.Summary.Reply.FastRatio}}</div><div class="s">样本 {{.View.Summary.Reply.SampleCount}} 次</div></div>
</div>
<p class="note">
  回复时延按相邻两条消息计算，分辨率为秒：同秒内的回复记 0 秒，样本 {{.View.Summary.Reply.SampleCount}} 次。
</p>

<section>
  <h2>话轮平衡</h2>
  <div class="bar">
    <i style="width:{{pct (split .View.Summary.TurnBalanceCharRatio)}};background:var(--self)"></i>
    <i style="width:{{rest (split .View.Summary.TurnBalanceCharRatio)}};background:var(--partner)"></i>
  </div>
  <div class="legend">
    <span><i class="dot" style="background:var(--self)"></i>我 {{.View.Summary.SelfChars}} 字 / {{.View.Summary.SelfMsgs}} 条</span>
    <span><i class="dot" style="background:var(--partner)"></i>对方 {{.View.Summary.PartnerChars}} 字 / {{.View.Summary.PartnerMsgs}} 条</span>
    <span>字数比 {{num2 .View.Summary.TurnBalanceCharRatio}} : 1</span>
    <span>消息数比 {{num2 .View.Summary.TurnBalanceMsgRatio}} : 1</span>
  </div>
  <p class="note">只统计条数与字数，不解释成谁更投入。两个比值可能指向相反的方向——话多而短，或话少而长。</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>作息与活跃度热力图</h2>
  <p class="note">行是周一至周日，列是 0–23 点（东八区）。颜色深浅为双方消息总量。</p>
  <div id="heat" class="chart tall"></div>
</section>

<div class="duo">
  <section>
    <h2>我的高频词</h2>
    <div id="wcSelf" class="chart tall"></div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>对方的高频词</h2>
    <div id="wcPartner" class="chart tall"></div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="duo">
  <section>
    <h2>我常用的表情</h2>
    <div id="emoSelf" class="chart"></div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>对方常用的表情</h2>
    <div id="emoPartner" class="chart"></div>
  </section>
</div>

<section>
  <h2>对方按月高频词</h2>
  <p class="note">图中是<strong>对方</strong>每月的常用词，同一行是一个词、不同颜色是不同月份，越靠右当月出现得越多。只统计已打分消息的文本，月份以东八区划分。</p>
  {{if .View.Monthly}}
  <div id="monthly" class="chart tall"></div>
  {{else}}
  <p class="note">还没有月度数据：历史词频只按全期累计，需要重扫才有月度视图。重新导入后不带 <code>--skip-sentiment</code> 再扫一遍，或加 <code>--rescore-words</code> 显式重扫即可。</p>
  {{end}}
</section>

<section>
  <h2>情绪分布</h2>
  {{if .View.EmotionSource}}
  <p class="note">七类情绪来自 {{.View.EmotionSource}}（词典规则匹配），仅覆盖被成功打分的消息{{if ne .View.EmotionSource .View.Meta.SentimentModelVersion}}。本次报告的情感模型是 {{.View.Meta.SentimentModelVersion}}，它不产出七类标签，所以这一节画的是 {{.View.EmotionSource}} 的判定，下面的正向占比也取自同一版{{end}}。「未匹配」是没命中任何情绪词，不是平静。</p>
  <div class="duo">
    <div id="radar" class="chart"></div>
    <div id="emoBar" class="chart"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="bar">
    <i style="width:{{pct .View.Emotion.PositiveRatio}};background:#3182ce"></i>
    <i style="width:{{rest .View.Emotion.PositiveRatio}};background:#c53030"></i>
  </div>
  <div class="legend">
    <span><i class="dot" style="background:#3182ce"></i>正向占已判定情绪 {{pct .View.Emotion.PositiveRatio}}</span>
    <span><i class="dot" style="background:#c53030"></i>负向</span>
    <span>中性/未匹配 {{.View.Emotion.NeutralCount}} 条，不计入该比例</span>
  </div>
  {{else}}
  <p class="note">当前版本不产出七类情绪，因此不画雷达图：没有任何已打分的版本留下「好 / 乐 / 哀 / 怒 / 惧 / 恶 / 惊」标签，而用极性符号伪造七类，会把「正向」当成一种情绪。极性分布见下方「情感走势」。</p>
  {{end}}
</section>

<section>
  <h2>情感走势</h2>
  <p class="note">
    每个点是「当天及之前 6 天」共 7 个日历日内所有已打分消息的极性均值，双方的消息合在一起算，不区分谁说的；所以点的条数是<b>窗口内</b>条数，不是当天条数。阴影是 ±1 SD（消息离散度，不是置信区间）：真正描述均值不确定性的标准误约为 SD / √条数，比这条带宽几十倍。均值含大量 0 极性中性消息，水平低位不等于关系平淡。
  </p>
  {{if .View.Trend.Drawable}}
  <div id="trend" class="chart tall"></div>
  <p class="note">可画 {{.View.Trend.Drawable}} 天，样本不足 {{.View.Trend.Thin}} 天；{{if ne .View.Trend.MeanLow .View.Trend.MeanHigh}}可画天的均值在 {{num2 .View.Trend.MeanLow}} 到 {{num2 .View.Trend.MeanHigh}} 之间{{else}}可画天的均值为 {{num2 .View.Trend.MeanLow}}{{end}}（-1 最负，+1 最正）。</p>
  <p class="note">
    x 轴按日历日铺满，没有打分消息的日子留空、折线在那里断开（不插值，也不补零）。窗口内不足 3 条的日子从折线里剔除，另用橙色散点标出。y 轴按数据自适应，但以 0 为中线上下对称、跨度至少 ±0.2：整幅固定成 [-1, 1] 会把实测中只有 0.065 的波动压成一条直线，读成「毫无波动」；完全不设下限又会把噪声放大成剧烈起伏。零基线固定在图的垂直中线（虚线）。
  </p>
  {{else}}
  <p class="note">样本不足：没有任何一天的 7 天窗口攒够 3 条已打分消息，因此不画折线图——不补零，也不画一张空白图。</p>
  {{end}}
</section>

{{if .View.Comparison.Present}}
<section>
  <h2>两版情感对照</h2>
  <p class="note">
    同一批消息被两个版本分别打过分。第一行是本次报告的情感模型，第二行是另一版。<strong>不一致率</strong>只在「两版都打过分」的消息上计算：两版把消息判到同一侧才算一致，而「侧」是三档（正 / 负 / 中性，极性恰好为 0 也算一档）。不一致不等于模型错——两版都可能错，只是错的地方不同。
  </p>
  <table>
    <tr><th>版本</th><th class="n">正向</th><th class="n">负向</th><th class="n">中性</th><th class="n">正向比例</th></tr>
    <tr>
      <td>{{.View.Comparison.Current.Version}}</td>
      <td class="n">{{.View.Comparison.Current.Positive}}</td>
      <td class="n">{{.View.Comparison.Current.Negative}}</td>
      <td class="n">{{.View.Comparison.Current.Neutral}}</td>
      <td class="n">{{pct .View.Comparison.Current.PositiveRatio}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>{{.View.Comparison.Other.Version}}</td>
      <td class="n">{{.View.Comparison.Other.Positive}}</td>
      <td class="n">{{.View.Comparison.Other.Negative}}</td>
      <td class="n">{{.View.Comparison.Other.Neutral}}</td>
      <td class="n">{{pct .View.Comparison.Other.PositiveRatio}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <div class="bar">
    <i style="width:{{pct .View.Comparison.Current.PositiveRatio}};background:#3182ce"></i>
    <i style="width:{{rest .View.Comparison.Current.PositiveRatio}};background:#c53030"></i>
  </div>
  <div class="legend">
    <span><i class="dot" style="background:#3182ce"></i>{{.View.Comparison.Current.Version}} 正向 {{pct .View.Comparison.Current.PositiveRatio}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="bar">
    <i style="width:{{pct .View.Comparison.Other.PositiveRatio}};background:#3182ce"></i>
    <i style="width:{{rest .View.Comparison.Other.PositiveRatio}};background:#c53030"></i>
  </div>
  <div class="legend">
    <span><i class="dot" style="background:#3182ce"></i>{{.View.Comparison.Other.Version}} 正向 {{pct .View.Comparison.Other.PositiveRatio}}</span>
  </div>
  <table>
    <tr><th>不一致率</th><th class="n">不一致 / 两版都打过分</th></tr>
    <tr><td>{{pct .View.Comparison.DisagreementRate}}</td><td class="n">{{.View.Comparison.Differing}} / {{.View.Comparison.BothScored}}</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p class="note">
    正向比例的分母是「有极性」的消息（正向 + 负向），中性不计入，与情绪分布区同一口径。不一致率的分母只算两版都给出数值的消息：只被一版打过分、或有一版没给出数值（NULL）的消息，既不算一致也不算不一致。
  </p>
</section>
{{end}}

<section>
  <h2>消息类型分布</h2>
  <div id="types" class="chart"></div>
  <p class="note">
    情感分析只读文本消息（msg_type=1），已打分 {{.View.Coverage.Scored}} / {{.View.Coverage.Total}} 条{{if .View.Coverage.Partial}}，<strong>本次为部分覆盖</strong>，情绪与词频只反映已打分的部分{{end}}。
  </p>
  {{if .View.Coverage.ExcludedTypes}}
  <table>
    <tr><th>被跳过的类型</th><th class="n">条数</th></tr>
    {{range .View.Coverage.ExcludedTypes}}<tr><td>msg_type = {{.MsgType}}</td><td class="n">{{.Count}}</td></tr>{{end}}
  </table>
  {{end}}
</section>

<footer class="note">本文件为自包含单页，不加载任何外部资源，打开时不产生网络请求。生成后请自行确认分享范围。</footer>

</div>

<script data-vendor="echarts">{{.ECharts}}</script>
<script data-vendor="echarts-wordcloud">{{.WordCloud}}</script>
<script id="report-data" type="application/json">{{.Data}}</script>
<script>
(function () {
  var D = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('report-data').textContent);
  var SELF = '#2b6cb0', PARTNER = '#c53030';
  var WEEKDAYS = ['周一', '周二', '周三', '周四', '周五', '周六', '周日'];
  var palette = ['#3182ce', '#38a169', '#805ad5', '#c53030', '#d69e2e', '#dd6b20', '#319795', '#718096'];

  function boot(id, build) {
    var node = document.getElementById(id);
    if (!node) { return; }
    var chart = echarts.init(node);
    chart.setOption(build());
    window.addEventListener('resize', function () { chart.resize(); });
  }
  function topPairs(list, limit) {
    return (list || []).slice(0, limit || 15).map(function (e) {
      return { name: e.Word, value: e.Count };
    });
  }
  function labelPairs(list) {
    return (list || []).map(function (e) { return { name: e.Word, value: e.Count }; });
  }

  boot('heat', function () {
    var cells = D.Heatmap || [], max = 0;
    var points = cells.map(function (c) {
      var total = c.SelfCount + c.PartnerCount;
      if (total > max) { max = total; }
      return { value: [c.Hour, c.Weekday, total], self: c.SelfCount, partner: c.PartnerCount };
    });
    return {
      grid: { left: 46, right: 16, top: 12, bottom: 40 },
      tooltip: {
        formatter: function (p) {
          return WEEKDAYS[p.data.value[1]] + ' ' + p.data.value[0] + ' 点<br>我 ' + p.data.self + ' 条 · 对方 ' + p.data.partner + ' 条';
        }
      },
      xAxis: { type: 'category', data: Array.from({ length: 24 }, function (_, h) { return h; }), splitArea: { show: true } },
      yAxis: { type: 'category', data: WEEKDAYS, splitArea: { show: true } },
      visualMap: { min: 0, max: max || 1, calculable: true, orient: 'horizontal', left: 'center', bottom: 0,
        inRange: { color: ['#ebf4fb', '#9ec6e6', '#4a86b8', '#1d4e79'] } },
      series: [{ type: 'heatmap', data: points, emphasis: { itemStyle: { borderColor: '#1a202c', borderWidth: 1 } } }]
    };
  });

  function cloud(id, list) {
    boot(id, function () {
      return {
        tooltip: { formatter: function (p) { return p.name + ' · ' + p.value + ' 次'; } },
        series: [{
          type: 'wordCloud', shape: 'circle', width: '96%', height: '96%',
          sizeRange: [12, 46], rotationRange: [-45, 45], rotationStep: 15,
          gridSize: 6, drawOutOfBound: false, textStyle: { color: function () { return palette[Math.floor(Math.random() * 3)]; } },
          emphasis: { textStyle: { color: SELF } },
          data: labelPairs(list)
        }]
      };
    });
  }
  cloud('wcSelf', (D.Words || {}).Self);
  cloud('wcPartner', (D.Words || {}).Partner);

  function emojiBar(id, list, color) {
    boot(id, function () {
      var pairs = topPairs(list, 12).reverse();
      return {
        grid: { left: 88, right: 32, top: 8, bottom: 24 },
        tooltip: { trigger: 'axis', axisPointer: { type: 'shadow' } },
        xAxis: { type: 'value' },
        yAxis: { type: 'category', data: pairs.map(function (p) { return p.name; }) },
        series: [{
          type: 'bar', data: pairs.map(function (p) { return p.value; }), itemStyle: { color: color },
          label: { show: true, position: 'right' }, barMaxWidth: 16
        }]
      };
    });
  }
  var emoji = D.Emoji || {};
  emojiBar('emoSelf', emoji.Self, SELF);
  emojiBar('emoPartner', emoji.Partner, PARTNER);

  // The monthly chart groups one horizontal bar per word by month: the same
  // word sits on one row and each month's count is a bar beside its neighbours.
  // Words are collected across months so a word that only appeared later still
  // has a row to grow into, and capped so the axis stays readable.
  boot('monthly', function () {
    var months = D.Monthly || [];
    if (!months.length) { return {}; }
    var words = [], seen = {};
    months.forEach(function (m) {
      (m.Words || []).forEach(function (w) {
        if (!w.Word || seen[w.Word]) { return; }
        seen[w.Word] = true;
        words.push(w.Word);
      });
    });
    words = words.slice(0, 16);
    var counts = {};
    months.forEach(function (m) {
      var byWord = {};
      (m.Words || []).forEach(function (w) { byWord[w.Word] = w.Count; });
      counts[m.Month] = byWord;
    });
    return {
      grid: { left: 104, right: 32, top: 30, bottom: 28 },
      legend: { top: 0 },
      tooltip: { trigger: 'axis', axisPointer: { type: 'shadow' } },
      xAxis: { type: 'value' },
      yAxis: { type: 'category', data: words, inverse: true },
      series: months.map(function (m, i) {
        return {
          name: m.Month, type: 'bar',
          data: words.map(function (w) { return counts[m.Month][w] || 0; }),
          itemStyle: { color: palette[i % palette.length] },
          barMaxWidth: 14
        };
      })
    };
  });

  var EMO_LABELS = ['好', '乐', '哀', '怒', '惧', '恶', '惊'];
  boot('radar', function () {
    var radar = (D.Emotion || {}).Radar || [];
    return {
      tooltip: {},
      radar: {
        indicator: EMO_LABELS.map(function (label) { return { name: label, max: 1 }; }),
        radius: '62%', splitNumber: 4
      },
      series: [{
        type: 'radar', areaStyle: { opacity: 0.25 }, lineStyle: { color: SELF }, itemStyle: { color: SELF },
        data: [{ value: radar.map(function (v) { return Number(v.toFixed(4)); }), name: '占比' }]
      }]
    };
  });

  boot('emoBar', function () {
    var counts = (D.Emotion || {}).Counts || {};
    var labels = EMO_LABELS.concat(['中性/未匹配']);
    return {
      grid: { left: 46, right: 16, top: 16, bottom: 28 },
      tooltip: { trigger: 'axis', axisPointer: { type: 'shadow' } },
      xAxis: { type: 'category', data: labels, axisLabel: { interval: 0 } },
      yAxis: { type: 'value' },
      series: [{
        type: 'bar', barMaxWidth: 32,
        data: labels.map(function (label, i) {
          return { value: counts[label] || 0, itemStyle: { color: palette[i % palette.length] } };
        })
      }]
    };
  });

  boot('types', function () {
    var seen = D.Summary.Types || [];
    var skipped = D.Coverage.ExcludedTypes || [];
    var merged = {}, order = [];
    seen.concat(skipped).forEach(function (t) { merged[t.MsgType] = (merged[t.MsgType] || 0) + t.Count; });
    Object.keys(merged).sort(function (a, b) { return Number(a) - Number(b); }).forEach(function (k) { order.push(k); });
    var skippedSet = {};
    skipped.forEach(function (t) { skippedSet[t.MsgType] = true; });
    return {
      grid: { left: 56, right: 16, top: 16, bottom: 28 },
      tooltip: { trigger: 'axis', axisPointer: { type: 'shadow' } },
      xAxis: { type: 'category', data: order.map(function (k) { return 'type ' + k; }), axisLabel: { interval: 0 } },
      yAxis: { type: 'value' },
      series: [{
        type: 'bar', barMaxWidth: 40,
        data: order.map(function (k) {
          return { value: merged[k], itemStyle: { color: skippedSet[k] ? '#cbd5e0' : SELF } };
        })
      }]
    };
  });
  // The trend's axis is calendar days, not the array's indices: day 1 sitting
  // next to day 10 would otherwise be drawn as two consecutive days. Missing
  // days stay on the axis as nulls so the line breaks there instead of
  // interpolating across them.
  var TREND_MEAN = '7 天滚动均值';
  var TREND_SD = '±1 SD（消息离散度，不是置信区间）';
  var TREND_THIN = '样本不足（窗口内 < 3 条，不画均值）';
  boot('trend', function () {
    var points = (D.Trend || {}).Points || [];
    if (!points.length) { return {}; }
    var byDay = {};
    points.forEach(function (p) { byDay[p.Day] = p; });
    function dayRange(first, last) {
      var out = [];
      var cur = new Date(first + 'T00:00:00Z');
      var end = new Date(last + 'T00:00:00Z');
      if (isNaN(cur.getTime()) || isNaN(end.getTime())) { return out; }
      while (cur.getTime() <= end.getTime() && out.length < 4000) {
        out.push(cur.toISOString().slice(0, 10));
        cur.setUTCDate(cur.getUTCDate() + 1);
      }
      return out;
    }
    var days = dayRange(points[0].Day, points[points.length - 1].Day);
    var mean = [], bandLow = [], bandSpan = [], thin = [];
    days.forEach(function (day, index) {
      var p = byDay[day];
      if (!p) { mean.push(null); bandLow.push(null); bandSpan.push(null); return; }
      if (!p.Drawable) {
        mean.push(null); bandLow.push(null); bandSpan.push(null);
        thin.push([index, Number(p.Mean.toFixed(4))]);
        return;
      }
      mean.push(Number(p.Mean.toFixed(4)));
      bandLow.push(Number((p.Mean - p.StdDev).toFixed(4)));
      bandSpan.push(Number((2 * p.StdDev).toFixed(4)));
    });
    // The half-height comes from the server. ECharts prints its min and max
    // labels verbatim, so a fitted bound like -0.3796374984823631 appeared on
    // screen as a full float clipped to "823631" beside the plot; the server
    // rounds it to two decimals and keeps it at least ±0.2 wide.
    var span = Number((D.Trend || {}).Axis) || 0.2;
    return {
      grid: { left: 52, right: 18, top: 16, bottom: 56 },
      legend: { bottom: 4, data: [TREND_MEAN, TREND_SD, TREND_THIN] },
      tooltip: {
        trigger: 'axis',
        formatter: function (params) {
          var day = params && params.length ? params[0].axisValue : '';
          var p = byDay[day];
          if (!p) { return day + '<br>没有打分消息，曲线在此断开'; }
          if (!p.Drawable) { return day + '<br>样本不足：窗口内 ' + p.Count + ' 条（少于 3 条），不画均值'; }
          return day + '<br>窗口内 ' + p.Count + ' 条<br>均值 ' + p.Mean.toFixed(3) +
            '<br>±1 SD ' + p.StdDev.toFixed(3) + '（消息离散度，不是置信区间）';
        }
      },
      xAxis: { type: 'category', data: days, axisLabel: { hideOverlap: true } },
      yAxis: {
        type: 'value', min: -span, max: span,
        // Two decimals regardless of the tick ECharts picks: the axis is a
        // reading aid, not a place for a sixteen-digit float.
        axisLabel: { formatter: function (v) { return Number(v).toFixed(2); } }
      },
      series: [
        {
          name: '', type: 'line', stack: 'sd', data: bandLow, connectNulls: false,
          lineStyle: { opacity: 0 }, symbol: 'none', silent: true
        },
        {
          name: TREND_SD, type: 'line', stack: 'sd', data: bandSpan, connectNulls: false,
          lineStyle: { opacity: 0 }, symbol: 'none', silent: true,
          areaStyle: { color: 'rgba(43,108,176,0.18)' }
        },
        {
          name: TREND_MEAN, type: 'line', data: mean, connectNulls: false,
          symbol: 'circle', symbolSize: 4,
          lineStyle: { width: 2, color: SELF }, itemStyle: { color: SELF },
          markLine: {
            silent: true, symbol: 'none', label: { show: false },
            lineStyle: { color: '#cbd5e0', type: 'dashed' }, data: [{ yAxis: 0 }]
          }
        },
        {
          name: TREND_THIN, type: 'scatter', data: thin, symbolSize: 9,
          itemStyle: { color: '#d69e2e' }
        }
      ]
    };
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>